  "description": "A high-performance, zero-reflection-at-runtime object-to-object mapper for .NET.\n      Mapping delegates are compiled once from Expression Trees to native IL and cached\n      for the lifetime of the Mapper instance. Supports bi-directional mapping, property\n      flattening, unflattening, nullable coercion, numeric widening, enum conversion,\n      and safe DFS cycle detection for self-referential object graphs.",
